# Ranperre's Final Rest at Endracion with the era module (mission_adjustments, RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, SoA off: its SoA
# case patches San d'Oria 6-2 section 2 (sections[2], .State(2)): 1035's finish runs the base (the book taken,
# requiredToZone, status 4) and the module (Timer to the next JST midnight); zoned with the Timer: the module's wait
# event 1037; after JST midnight: the base's 1039, status 5.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2009 NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1033 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1034 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1035 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1036 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1039 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1040 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1033 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1035 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1039 ChateauDoraguille/_6h0/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/Perfaumand/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/21 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/81 KingRanperresTomb/_5a0/onTrigger KingRanperresTomb/Tombstone_Lower/onTrigger KingRanperresTomb/onEventFinish/5 KingRanperresTomb/onEventFinish/6 KingRanperresTomb/onEventFinish/8
module modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
mission Sandoria TheRescueDrill completed
mission Sandoria TheDavoiReport completed
mission Sandoria JourneyAbroad completed
mission Sandoria InfiltrateDavoi completed
mission Sandoria TheCrystalSpring completed
mission Sandoria AppointmentToJeuno completed
mission Sandoria Magicite completed
mission Sandoria TheRuinsOfFeiYin completed
mission Sandoria TheShadowLord completed
mission Sandoria LeautesLastWishes completed
mission Sandoria RanperresFinalRest current
rank 6
keyitem PieceOfPaper
keyitem AncientSanDorianBook
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
login
missionstatus Sandoria 3
trigger Endracion                       # the book: 1035
finish                                  # base: book taken, requiredToZone, status 4; module: Timer to JST midnight
warp -240,7,58 NorthernSanDoria
warp -108.5,1,-34 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Endracion                       # status 4, zoned, Timer: the module's 1037
finish
wait jst=1                              # the Timer expired
trigger Endracion                       # status 4, no Timer: the base, zoned: 1039/1040
finish                                  # status 5
